  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia-Vietnam Energy Transition Platform (AVETP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia-Vietnam Energy Transition Platform (AVETP) is a climate finance mechanism to leverage private sector investment into the net zero transition in Vietnam. An allocation of $17 million will support the Renewable Energy Access and Capital Markets for Climate Action funds, as well as new opportunities in green infrastructure projects identified by InfraCo Asia and GuarantCo, through the Private Infrastructure Development Group. AVETP also includes a $3 million allocation for funds targeting small-and-medium enterprises through Australian Development Investments.</narrative>
  </description>
